## 3. PAGE STRUCTURE & SECTION-BY-SECTION SPECIFICATIONS

**3.1 Masthead & Navigation** — Skip-to-content link (visible on focus). `<header>` with display-serif wordmark, issue number/date in mono, and `.nav` (double-rule bracket): mono uppercase anchor links to every section, theme toggle, and a "Menu" toggle below ~768px opening a dropdown panel (`--z-dropdown`, `aria-expanded`/`aria-controls`, keyboard operable). If sticky, use surface background + `--shadow-sm`.

**3.2 Hero** — Art-directed asymmetric spread (text ≈55% / image ≈45%, stacked on mobile): mono kicker ("Issue No. 12 — The Craft Issue"), `h1` in Playfair via `clamp()` up to `--text-5xl`, lede paragraph with **drop cap** (`::first-letter`, `--dropcap-font`, float, ~3.5em, `--color-primary`), byline row in mono, CTAs (`.btn--primary` + `.btn`), and a large `figure` with `figcaption` mono italic caption. Use seeded picsum placeholders (`https://picsum.photos/seed/<seed>/<w>/<h>`, explicit `width`/`height`, descriptive `alt`), art-directed with a subtle CSS filter for mood.

**3.3 Features** — Kicker + `h2` + standfirst; 3 `.card` grid (`repeat(3, 1fr)` → 1 column on mobile, equal height); each card: Material icon or oversized serif numeral, `h3` with double-rule underline, body copy, mono caption/link; hover and focus-within per 2.2.

**3.4 How It Works** — 3 steps: oversized Playfair numerals (01/02/03) in `--color-primary`, mono step label, title, description; steps connected by a thin `--color-border` rule; 3-column → 1-column.

**3.5 Testimonials** — 2–3 pull quotes: `blockquote` with oversized serif `“` via CSS `::before` (never inline SVG), quote in display serif italic at `--text-lg`/`--text-xl`, attribution in mono uppercase with em dash; optional portrait imagery with captions; multi-column grid collapsing to one column.

**3.6 Pricing** — 3 tiers; middle tier featured (`.card--featured`: `--color-surface-strong` background, `--shadow-md`, `.badge` "Most Popular", `--color-primary` border emphasis). Each tier: mono plan kicker, price in Playfair at `--text-3xl`, feature list with Material `check` icons, CTA (`.btn--primary` on featured, `.btn` elsewhere). Billing toggle (monthly/annual): button group with `role="group"`, `aria-pressed` per option, prices updating with a visible transition and an `aria-live="polite"` announcement; fine print in mono `--text-xs`.

**3.7 FAQ** — 4–6 items per 2.5; kicker + `h2`; optional two-column desktop layout → single column on mobile.

**3.8 Final CTA** — Full-bleed band on `--color-surface-strong` (dark equivalent in dark mode) with a double-rule top divider; centered flex column; display-serif headline; email capture `.input-group` (`type="email"`, `autocomplete="email"`, real client-side validation) + `.btn--primary` submit exercising loading → success/error states per 2.1/2.3; inline success message in an `aria-live` region; no `alert()`.

**3.9 Footer** — Wordmark repeat; 3–4 columns of secondary links (About, Archive, Contact, Privacy, Terms, social text links); mono uppercase column headings with double-rule underline; copyright line in mono; back-to-top anchor with `arrow_upward`. Navigational links use on-page anchors; never dead-end the keyboard.

