## 5. DELIVERABLE & OUTPUT FORMAT

- **Files:** separate `index.html`, `style.css`, `script.js`. No inline `<script>` blocks beyond a single `<script src="script.js" defer>` entry point; no inline styles; no inline SVGs.
- **Naming:** BEM consistently (`block__element--modifier`, matching `.btn--primary`); never mix conventions.
- **Copy:** original English editorial copy throughout — no lorem ipsum; descriptive `alt` text and captions on every image; picsum placeholders permitted only because imagery was unspecified.
- **Completeness:** all nine page areas built and fully functional when `index.html` is opened directly — no build step, no external JS beyond Google Fonts/Material Symbols links. Validate both light and dark modes before declaring done.
